        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a fine autumn day, the sun is out, and the voices in your head are screaming with options.<br><br>OTHERS is a looping story game about thoughts where you unlock new voices in your head, driving new ideas, new scenarios, and new endings.<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voice-acted</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>text-based</strong> and <strong>point-and-click controls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good voices</strong> to listen to</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;What do you mean by &quot;<strong>good&quot;</strong> voices to listen to?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, some people just like to listen to only the &quot;good&quot; voices. Be quiet, I'm writing a Steam &quot;About&quot; Section</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;Sorry, I don't mean to bother you, but I was just thinking that maybe you could give a shoutout to some of us <strong>morally ambiguous voices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morally ambiguous voices</strong> to listen to</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;See, that's nice! It lets the person know that they can be a charming rogue in this game. Oh, by the way, did you write the hook already?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, it's up at the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;I feel like this &quot;about&quot; section very much reflects the feeling of playing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's hope so for both our sakes.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> Looping Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;you should say more about us voices in your head!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >oh sure.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voices that just won't shut up.</strong></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a fine autumn day, the sun is out, and the voices in your head are screaming with options.<br><br>OTHERS is a looping story game about thoughts where you unlock new voices in your head, driving new ideas, new scenarios, and new endings.<br><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voice-acted</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>text-based</strong> and <strong>point-and-click controls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good voices</strong> to listen to</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;What do you mean by &quot;<strong>good&quot;</strong> voices to listen to?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, some people just like to listen to only the &quot;good&quot; voices. Be quiet, I'm writing a Steam &quot;About&quot; Section</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;Sorry, I don't mean to bother you, but I was just thinking that maybe you could give a shoutout to some of us <strong>morally ambiguous voices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morally ambiguous voices</strong> to listen to</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;See, that's nice! It lets the person know that they can be a charming rogue in this game. Oh, by the way, did you write the hook already?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah, it's up at the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;I feel like this &quot;about&quot; section very much reflects the feeling of playing the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's hope so for both our sakes.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A<strong> Looping Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;&gt;you should say more about us voices in your head!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >oh sure.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voices that just won't shut up.</strong></p></li></ul>",
